Sunday - last PP in this Canada Pre Tour!

For the last day, we got some reinforcements - Chaitanya + Adi

Two PP in one day - double punch KO

Both PP were packed!

In Lethbridge, I had a one-on-one with a seeker who was shocked when she felt hot on both hands. She was in awe - because she has been trying to meditate. She would wake up at 4 am every morning and try to meditate.

During the PP, she said that she finally felt something. That the meditation was truly powerful. I worked on her, and we got rid of the heat on both hands.

She then opened up about some challenges in her life - so we did a meditation focusing on these things. When I opened my eyes, I saw her in a deep state of meditation - with a tear down her cheek. The meditation was focused on removing small depressions - finding our self-worth. Super powerful meditation.

What a way to end this tour! Stress-free tour!

Drive Update: 6574km

Number of Self-Realizations: 208

